(This handbook explains how we work at Northwind Traders. It is a sample document written for) Tj T*
(demonstrations and does not describe a real company.) Tj T*
T*
(Working hours. Our standard week is 40 hours. Core hours are 10 a.m. to 3 p.m. local time,) Tj T*
(when everyone is expected to be available. Outside core hours you may start and finish) Tj T*
(earlier or later, with your manager's agreement.) Tj T*
T*
(Your manager is your first contact for questions about your role, your schedule and your) Tj T*
(development. People Operations can help with benefits, leave and anything you would rather) Tj T*
(not raise with your manager.) Tj T*
ET
