BT /F2 17 Tf 56 736 Td (Time off) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 702 Td 15 TL
(Vacation. Full-time employees earn 15 days of paid vacation in their first three years and) Tj T*
(20 days after that. Please request vacation at least two weeks in advance through the HR) Tj T*
(portal. Your manager will reply within three working days.) Tj T*
T*
(Sick leave. You receive 10 paid sick days each year. A doctor's note is needed if you are) Tj T*
(away for more than three days in a row. Please tell your manager as early as you can on the) Tj T*
(first day you are unwell.) Tj T*
T*
(Parental leave. New parents are entitled to 12 weeks of fully paid leave, whether they are a) Tj T*
(birth parent, an adoptive parent or a foster parent. Leave can be taken in one block or) Tj T*
(split into two blocks within the first year.) Tj T*
T*
(Public holidays. The company observes ten public holidays each year. The list is posted in) Tj T*
(the HR portal every January.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 40 Td (Northwind Traders Employee Handbook \(sample document\)  -  Page 2 of 6) Tj ET
