BT /F2 17 Tf 56 736 Td (Remote and hybrid work) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 702 Td 15 TL
(Most roles are hybrid: three days a week in the office and two days from home. Your team) Tj T*
(agrees which days are the office days so that everyone overlaps.) Tj T*
T*
(Home office support. Northwind pays a stipend of $40 per month toward your home internet.) Tj T*
(You can also claim up to $300 once for a desk chair or monitor.) Tj T*
T*
(Security when working remotely. Always connect to the company VPN when you use company data) Tj T*
(away from the office. Never work on company documents on a public computer, and lock your) Tj T*
(screen when you step away.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 40 Td (Northwind Traders Employee Handbook \(sample document\)  -  Page 3 of 6) Tj ET
