BT /F2 17 Tf 56 736 Td (Expenses and travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 702 Td 15 TL
(Claiming expenses. Submit expense claims within 30 days of spending the money, with a) Tj T*
(receipt for anything over $25. Claims are paid with your next salary.) Tj T*
T*
(Meals while travelling are reimbursed up to $60 per day. Alcohol is not reimbursed.) Tj T*
T*
(Flights. Book economy class for flights shorter than six hours. Longer flights may be booked) Tj T*
(in premium economy with your manager's approval.) Tj T*
T*
(Approvals. Any single purchase above $500 needs your manager's approval before you buy it.) Tj T*
(Purchases above $5,000 also need approval from Finance.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 40 Td (Northwind Traders Employee Handbook \(sample document\)  -  Page 4 of 6) Tj ET
