BT /F2 17 Tf 56 736 Td (Information security) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 702 Td 15 TL
(Passwords. Company passwords must have at least 14 characters. Use the company password) Tj T*
(manager and turn on multi-factor authentication for every work account.) Tj T*
T*
(Phishing. If you receive a suspicious email, do not click anything. Report it to) Tj T*
(security@northwind.example within one hour, even if you are not sure.) Tj T*
T*
(Lost or stolen devices. Report a lost or stolen laptop or phone immediately, day or night,) Tj T*
(by calling the security hotline. Do not wait until the next working day.) Tj T*
T*
(Removable media. Do not plug personal USB drives into company computers. Use the approved) Tj T*
(cloud storage to share files.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 40 Td (Northwind Traders Employee Handbook \(sample document\)  -  Page 5 of 6) Tj ET
