BT /F2 17 Tf 56 736 Td (Conduct and benefits) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 702 Td 15 TL
(Code of conduct. We treat each other with respect. Harassment and discrimination are never) Tj T*
(acceptable. You can report a concern to your manager, to People Operations or, anonymously,) Tj T*
(through the ethics hotline.) Tj T*
T*
(Health insurance. Your health insurance starts on the first day of the month after you join.) Tj T*
(Dental and vision cover are optional.) Tj T*
T*
(Retirement. Northwind matches your 401\(k\) contributions up to 4 percent of your salary,) Tj T*
(starting after your first month.) Tj T*
T*
(Learning. Each employee has a learning budget of $1,000 per year for courses, books and) Tj T*
(conferences.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 40 Td (Northwind Traders Employee Handbook \(sample document\)  -  Page 6 of 6) Tj ET
